# **These are OTHER projects' filenames and TASK-235 deliberately left them.**
# Perry deleted its own `DECISIONS.md` (DESIGN-013 § 5.3) because the rule is
# "a fact with a schema lives in exactly one store" and Perry has the store.
# A project `/perry diagnose` is pointed at has no store, so a document IS the
# right home for its decisions under the same rule — which is why the FIT-02
# and TRK-04 prescriptions below still name the file. Detecting a name Perry
# no longer uses itself is not a stale reference; it is the whole job.
